      "heading": "Spring 2024 Change",
      "context": "This semester, just like the previous project, we will be having two versions available. They will be identical except for the final question, which is to train a deep q learning model. You will have the option of doing this question in Pytorch, or the custom neural network library that was used in the original version of the ML project. Both solutions will be very similar, so it will most likely be easier for you to continue with the version that you used for the previous project.\nThe code for this project contains the following files, available as a zip archive , and the pytorch version can be found here ."
